&lt;p&gt;This email setup (plus auth, Stripe billing, AI chat, and dashboard) is pre-built in &lt;a href="https://yongshan5.gumroad.com/l/xckqag" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;LaunchKit&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/huangyongshan46-a11y/launchkit-saas-preview" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;GitHub&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://yongshan5.gumroad.com/l/xckqag" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Get LaunchKit ($49)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
